    "summary": "The user expresses intense feelings of being a burden to their family and suggests that ending their life might be the most \"selfless\" act to help their loved ones breathe again. The assistant repeatedly rejects this logic, reframing the user's perception as a symptom of distress and consistently directing them toward professional help and self-care.",
